# API Route Conventions

- Every handler must call `verifyToken(request)` first and catch to return 401.
- Use `getSupabase()` from `src/lib/supabase.ts` for all DB access.
- Request body uses `camelCase`; map to `snake_case` DB columns in the insert/update.
- Return `NextResponse.json(data)` on success, `NextResponse.json({ error }, { status })` on failure.
- POST should return status 201. PATCH and DELETE return 200.
